Description:
  Reconstructs fixed-target laboratory DIS kinematics directly from the
  incoming proton and positron and the highest-energy prompt final-state
  positron, excluding leptons from hadron decays.
  Events satisfy 1 <= Q2 <= 20 GeV2, 0.1 < y <= 0.91, W2 > 3.24 GeV2,
  and 0.04 <= theta <= 0.22 rad. Raw cross-section, inverse-depolarization,
  and covariance-proxy histograms are supplied for external four-helicity
  POSNLO+NEGNLO combination. A nested Q2 > 4 GeV2 selection is included as
  a conservative diagnostic. The R1990 parameterization is used for R; the
  conversion to A1 neglects eta*A2 and does not separately model g2. The
  Q2 > 1 result reaches the lower scale boundary of the selected PDFs and is
  therefore exploratory.
